## Installation

**Prerequisites:** Python 3.14+, PostgreSQL (the app's own database — there is no development instance to start), direnv, Node.js 22+, pnpm

```bash
git clone git@github.com:poodle64/{{ project_name }}.git
cd {{ project_name }}
direnv allow
cp .envrc.local.example .envrc.local   # set POSTGRES_PASSWORD and your dev identity
uv run --project backend alembic upgrade head
```

```bash
uv run --project backend uvicorn {{ package_name }}.server:app --reload --port {{ backend_port }}   # backend
pnpm -C frontend dev   # frontend, http://localhost:{{ frontend_port }}
```

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Choice |
| --- | --- |
| Backend | FastAPI, SQLAlchemy + Alembic, PostgreSQL |
| Frontend | SvelteKit (Svelte 5), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4, `@poodle64/ui` |
| Shape | household canonical full-stack template — see `DESIGN.md` and `rules-library/platform/canonical-app-shape.md` |

